OL,3,GNEWSASwinney's 100-day push gives way
OL,4,Ato bigger battles ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere have been a flurry of
OL,7,Fannouncements from John Swinney over
OL,8,Fthe summer as he works to fulfill the
OL,9,Fpledges for the first 100 days of the
OL,10,FSNP returning to power which he made
OL,11,Fahead of the Holyrood election in May.
OL,13,FFor example, last week the first
OL,14,Fminister formally opened the 11th GP
OL,15,Fwalk-in centre and announced locations
OL,16,Ffor an expanded network across
OL,17,FScotland.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
