OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASwinney's 100-day push gives way
OL,4,Ato bigger battles ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat ticked off one of his 100-day
OL,7,Fcommitments but it does not in itself
OL,8,Fend the early morning rush for GP
OL,9,Fappointments or the wider backlog in
OL,10,Fthe NHS.
OL,12,FMinisters hope walk-in centres will
OL,13,Fmake a worthwhile contribution but the
OL,14,FRoyal College of GPs and political
OL,15,Frivals are sceptical after early
OL,16,Fstatistics suggested underuse.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
